<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 408bps, 313 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 408bps, 313 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 408 basis points on Wednesday from Tuesday's 407.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also increased to 313 basis points from 310 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.57%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.50%	408	407 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.41%	416	415 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.44%	313	310 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.20%	337	337 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.12%	345	344 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.02%	255	252 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.18%	339	338 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0905 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
